<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! sense.petname.proposes ~ a pet name proposed, awaiting acceptance

`lares sensorium propose-name <sensorium> <subject> <label…> projection=<handle> [evidence=ref,ref]` records a proposed pet name with the projection that proposes it and its evidence refs; `accept-name` lands it.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ propose

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`propose` params=`sensorium/memory subject/e-12 label/harbor projection/structure evidence/d-1,d-2 ~ propose a pet name with evidence`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ sensorium · subject · label · projection · evidence

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`sensorium` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<sensorium> ~ a named sensorium standing on this house`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`subject` params=`takes/id needs/required seat/2 as/<subject> ~ the subject named`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`label` params=`takes/words needs/required seat/3 as/<label…> ~ the proposed pet name`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`projection` params=`takes/handle needs/required ~ the projection proposing it`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`evidence` params=`takes/list ~ evidence refs, comma-joined`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ works this host's scratch sensoria under the cache; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[sense.petname.proposes sensorium/memory subject/e-12 label/harbor projection/structure]] ~ name a standing sensorium, a subject, a label and --projection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

